a-start=\"749\" data-end=\"758\">Band:</strong> RVS horlogeband<br data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"777\"><strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"790\">Functies:</strong> Tijd, datum, chronograaf<br data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"818\"><strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"841\">Waterbestendigheid:</strong> 5 ATM<br data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"850\"><strong data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"872\">Kleur wijzerplaat:</strong> Zwart<br data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"881\"><strong data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"896\">Kleur band:</strong> Zilver<br data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"906\"><strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"916\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1004\">📦 <strong data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"953\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"956\">Emporio Armani AR2448 Horloge<br data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"988\">Extra schakels</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1063\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1028\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1031\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
